concat: lineit
length of añadir: 6
upper: SHOUT
lower: quiet
trim: spaces
find na in banana: 2
last 3 of lineit: eit
replace: a + b + c
repeat: ababab
split: ["red", "green", "blue"]
last part: blue
parts: 3
joined: red / green / blue
format: lineit has 6 letters
constant: 0.5
" 42 " as an int, times 2: 84
3.5 as a string: 3.5
